  graph_legend [shape="plain", fontname="DejaVu Sans", fontsize="10", fontcolor="#475569", label="Solid grey: numbered prerequisite; transitively redundant edges are omitted.\nDashed purple: trusted literature input. Dashed grey labelled 'method reuse': reuse of a proof.\nPurple: trusted references. Green: certified. Yellow: pending certification.\nCertification status is separate from the mathematical audit.\nReference proofs are accepted; each application must match the cited result.\nClick a result or reference for its inventory entry."];
